  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Conflict-driven energy shocks (gas cutoffs, constrained power supplies) force semiconductor fabs and associated logistics in affected regions to curtail production runs or shift output schedules, reducing available chip manufacturing and delivery capacity against demand.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
