  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.95</data>
  <data key="d37">Physical interruptions to extraction, pipeline and export terminal operations (repairs, shutdowns, contested access) directly reduce the volumetric flow of crude and associated liquids from upstream facilities.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_shock</data>
