  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising political and military incentives to escalate accelerate procurement and fielding decisions for AI-enabled ISR, targeting, and decision‑support systems, causing organizations on both sides of the China–West divide to push more models into production faster.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
