  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising incentives for escalation in the Russia–Ukraine theater (through precedent-setting use of force and perceived Western distraction) embolden Iran-aligned groups to increase maritime attacks to exploit perceived windows of opportunity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">us_iran_gulf_conflict</data>
