  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher frequency and intensity of kinetic attacks directly increases the physical threat to tankers, terminals and transits, raising measured maritime security risk for energy logistics.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_gulf_conflict</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_shock</data>
