  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained kinetic attacks on maritime traffic force the US and partners to divert naval escorts, munitions and replenishment stocks toward immediate regional needs, directly reducing the volume of weapons and munitions available for transfer to Ukraine.</data>
