  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising perceived shipping risk immediately raises insurance premia and logistics costs and prompts investors and corporates to pull or reroute capital and trade finance, reducing net cross‑border capital and trade‑related inflows to the affected corridor.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_gulf_conflict</data>
  <data key="d40">monetary_policy_shock</data>
