  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A higher instantaneous risk of accidental engagements raises the probability of interdiction, port closures, and damaged shipments of critical semiconductor components and fab equipment, causing near‑term reductions or delays in available chip manufacturing capacity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
