  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in accidental engagement incidents sharply increases investors' perceived tail‑risk of broader conflict escalation, leading them to demand higher risk premia on affected sovereign debt and thus widening sovereign spreads.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_gulf_conflict</data>
