<edge source="china_west_rivalry::chip_supply_capacity" target="global_energy_shock::upstream_prod_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Constrained semiconductor and server hardware supply delays delivery and maintenance of digitally controlled drilling rigs, pumps and telemetry systems, causing slower commissioning and higher downtime that reduce upstream oil production rates.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">china_west_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_shock</data>
</edge>
<edge source="china_west_rivalry::chip_supply_capacity" target="russia_ukraine_war::arms_transfer_volume" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher chip supply capacity increases availability of components for drones, guidance units and electronic warfare gear, permitting higher production and export volumes of those systems into the Russia–Ukraine theatre.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">china_west_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="china_west_rivalry::chip_supply_capacity" target="us_iran_gulf_conflict::accidental_engagement_ri" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher semiconductor and sensor hardware availability enables upgrades and redundancy in naval, air and commercial navigation systems, reducing sensor failures and misidentification that can precipitate accidental engagements.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">china_west_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">us_iran_gulf_conflict</data>
