  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained rise in crude prices increases the strategic and economic stakes tied to Gulf supply, incentivizing actors to take riskier coercive measures or deterrent responses that accelerate the cycle of action and counteraction.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_shock</data>
  <data key="d40">us_iran_gulf_conflict</data>
